  "post_content": "<p>Este s&aacute;bado,&nbsp;1 de abril, se ha celebrado en la piscina municipal cubierta de Onda la 6&ordf; Jornada de Liga Promesas de nataci&oacute;n.&nbsp;Han participado&nbsp;un total de 141 ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as de toda la provincia de Castell&oacute;n, entre los que estaba el Club Nataci&oacute;n Onda, con 7 chicos y 5 chicas que&nbsp;han mejorado&nbsp;todas sus marcas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/EquipClubNatacioOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><strong>200 ESTILOS MASCULINO</strong></p>\n<p>AYAN PAUL DERIUS &ndash; 4&acute;15&rdquo;49</p>\n<p>JUAN GARCIA GARCIA &ndash; 3&acute;47&rdquo;17</p>\n<p>IKER RUIZ GIMENEZ &ndash; 3&acute;47&rdquo;57</p>\n<p>STEFAN VALENTIN NICHIFOR &ndash; 3&acute;37&rdquo;14</p>\n<p>PAU CAMPOS GAYET &ndash; 3&acute;23&rdquo;76</p>\n<p>ALEX WISEMAN ROCA &ndash; 3&acute;15&rdquo;21</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/P1550238.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><strong>200 ESTILOS FEMENINO</strong></p>\n<p>ANA MU&Ntilde;OZ MARTINEZ &ndash; 3&acute;55&rdquo;16</p>\n<p>CARMEN BOU MERINO &ndash; 3&acute;54&rdquo;10</p>\n<p>MIREIA GARCIA AGUILELLA &ndash; 3&acute;48&rdquo;86</p>\n<p>MARTA GARCIA LLOPIS &ndash; 3&acute;28&rdquo;96</p>\n<p><strong>400 ESTILOS MASCULINO</strong></p>\n<p>HUGO VILLENA MURCIA &ndash; 6&acute;03&rdquo;39</p>\n<p><strong>100 LIBRE FEMENINO</strong></p>\n<p>INAYA JIMENEZ ZAPATA &ndash; 1&acute;27&rdquo;73</p>\n<p><strong>100 LIBRE MASCULINO</strong></p>\n<p>HUGO VILLENA MURCIA &ndash; 1&acute;08&rdquo;91</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/equipclubnatacioonda.jpg\" alt=\"equipclubnatacioonda\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550229.jpg\" alt=\"p1550229\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550230.jpg\" alt=\"p1550230\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550231.jpg\" alt=\"p1550231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550233.jpg\" alt=\"p1550233\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550235.jpg\" alt=\"p1550235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550237.jpg\" alt=\"p1550237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550238.jpg\" alt=\"p1550238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550239.jpg\" alt=\"p1550239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550241.jpg\" alt=\"p1550241\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550242.jpg\" alt=\"p1550242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/6%c2%aajornadalligapromesesnatacioonda010417/p1550244.jpg\" alt=\"p1550244\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev